## 9. Error Handling

### 9.1 Common Errors and Solutions

| Error | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| "Folder not found" | Invalid path in B2 | Verify folder path exists and is correctly typed |
| "No matches found" | No files match all keywords | Try fewer keywords or different terms |
| "Please enter folder path" | Empty cell B2 | Enter folder path before running |
| "Please enter at least one keyword" | All keyword cells empty | Enter at least one keyword |
| File access errors (during copy) | Permissions or locked files | Check file permissions and close open files |

### 9.2 Error Recovery
- All functions include error handling
- SearchFileContent() silently skips unreadable files
- CopyFoundFiles() reports individual file failures without stopping

