## 10. Technical Specifications

### 10.1 System Requirements
- Microsoft Excel 2010 or later
- Windows operating system
- Macro security set to allow VBA execution

### 10.2 Limitations
- Searches single folder only (no subfolder recursion)
- Maximum file content size: Limited by available memory
- Text file encoding: ANSI/UTF-8 (other encodings may cause errors)
- Network paths: Supported but may be slower

### 10.3 Dependencies
- Scripting.FileSystemObject (Windows built-in)
- System.Collections.ArrayList (.NET Framework)

