### 13.2 Glossary

- **Progressive Filtering**: Sequential application of filters where each level narrows results from the previous level
- **Candidate Files**: Files that remain under consideration after each filtering level
- **Text File**: File with readable text content (as opposed to binary files)
- **Hyperlink**: Clickable link in Excel that opens the associated file
- **FileSystemObject**: Windows COM object for file system operations
- **ArrayList**: Dynamic collection object that can grow/shrink as needed

